06\\\",\\n  \\\"privacyError\\\": \\\"CREATOR_WORKFLOW_READ_PRIVACY_UNAVAILABLE\\\",\\n  \\\"oversizeCaseError\\\": \\\"CREATOR_WORKFLOW_READ_LIMIT_EXCEEDED\\\",\\n  \\\"rowLimitError\\\": \\\"CREATOR_WORKFLOW_READ_LIMIT_EXCEEDED\\\",\\n  \\\"originalVolumeTouched\\\": false,\\n  \\\"originalUserOrBudgetApproval\\\": false\\n}\\nFILE .evidence/qyh-creator-workflow-read-failure-ui-20261014/implementation-plan.md SHA 3406befcf096ec854142608dc592f4f05a3d64bbc39d0f4aa137ceacd4610ce3\\n# 内部草稿读取失败与历史暂存区分方案\\n\\nRules/231/AGENTS同owner/base2030/16:00UTC精确CreatorGrowthPage.tsx与原test，其他CSS/组件/AIPStore不改。上位产品为六类内部准备/版本精确/人审且外部触达独立；继续全部长Goal。本波修复读取失败语义，不借此授予任何内部或外部命令权限。实际原API仍f005、Web6c，新有界reader已代码候选5a1855482但未接线。\\n\\n现load吞list错误且未改变旧workflowDrafts。修复引入 workflowReadState（loading/ready/failed）与独立固定业务错误文本：load开始设loading，新id胜出的完整list成功为ready，null为failed。空[]也是合法ready，不能与failed混同；错误不输出异常/SQL/secret。保留旧workflowDrafts仅为明确标记的“上次读取的暂存内容”，verified current accessor在state!=ready时不存在；history useEffect仅访问verified current，无当前准入不继续history读取/恢复。响应stale id仍现有request ref拒绝，不引入复制客户端租户状态机。\\n\\n不销毁用户正在编辑的字段或已发生操作Receipt/idempotencyKey。PreparationPanel增加readUnavailable prop，读取中或失败时提示“当前内部草稿暂未读取，暂存内容不能作为当前版本操作”；如果有cache，状态文字必须明确“上次读取”。保持cache prop ref/revision不因失败变动，避免现hydrate effect覆盖未保存输入；失败时不自动清空编辑，不改原成功更新version的水合语义。触发明确重新读取后不同服务端新revision仍原hydrate处理，不宣称解决全部多用户编辑冲突；CAS版本仍后端权威。\\n\\n所有真正workflow命令按钮(save/submit/approve/reject/restore)及新建一份仅state ready才采用原busy/字段/status判断；executeWorkflow入口还须guard readstate!=ready，早于生成intent/key/任何client call，防仅禁button不足。关闭/导航/只读重新读取可用；准备表单可以查看/保留暂存，但不能把cache ref发给服务器。不自动重试execute，不重置unknown/attempted命令key，不复用read成功作预算/审批决定。原命令成功+history失败保留新draft/Receipt，与list读取故障是不同state和错误来源；原正常读取/空态/内部合法流程保持。\\n\\nRED：首次list失败→明确unknown且所有命令0调用，真实empty→合法入口；已有draft/编辑后重新读取失败→cache明确历史/不再verified current/所有写按钮及restore禁用/输入保留/Receipt不消失；重新读取成功→当前状态恢复只读显示和既有guard，失败期间没有execute重发；成功命令history失败原回归、stale async load不覆盖新snapshot。先独立plan合法消费、最小2文件修改，Vitest本组件/API strictclient及相邻工作台、typecheck按已装环境（不改pnpm锁或重装）。真实浏览器所有动作限read/UI，不保存/approve/execute；故障UI验收使用授权隔离localfixture/受控client响应，不在原库造坏数据。按原稿三视口只核状态显示/不遮挡和主结构；1280按钮裁切与价格255px仍另待，不能P1合格。\\n\\nUI与root接线需各自代码质量/精确最新已提交冻结/API和Web fresh维护门/原真人GET菜单/650指纹/独立现场Prime及准确各scopeDelivery之后才同步Authority/Prime。日报及每次aos仍最新m1原权威卷完整PG→API→Web；aos-2不重启。完整BudgetC/用户最后真实批准/原部署/自然首链/安装全生命周期/八场景/全视觉/观察发布仍未完成。\\n\\nCURRENT ORIGINAL FUNC get_ecommerce_creator_internal_workflow\\ndef get_ecommerce_creator_internal_workflow() -> EcommerceCreatorInternalWorkflow:\\n    return EcommerceCreatorInternalWorkflow()\\nCURRENT ORIGINAL FUNC _map_creator_internal_workflow_error\\ndef _map_creator_internal_workflow_error(exc: CreatorInternalWorkflowError) -> ApiError:\\n    if isinstance(exc, CreatorInternalWorkflowConflict):\\n        return ApiError(code=exc.code, message=str(exc), status_code=409)\\n    return ApiError(code=exc.code, message=\\\"Creator internal workflow failed closed\\\", status_code=503)\\nCURRENT ORIGINAL FUNC _reject_query_parameters\\ndef _reject_query_parameters(request: Request) -> None:\\n    if request.query_params:\\n        raise ApiError(\\n            code=\\\"VALIDATION\\\",\\n            message=\\\"ecommerce Workshop reads do not accept query parameters\\\",\\n            status_code=400,\\n        )\\nCURRENT ORIGINAL FUNC _invoke\\ndef _invoke(operation: Callable[[], ResultT]) -> ResultT:\\n    try:\\n        return operation()\\n    except AssetRegistryError as exc:\\n        raise ApiError(\\n            code=exc.code.value,\\n            message=str(exc),\\n            status_code=exc.http_status,\\n            details=exc.details,\\n        ) from exc\\nCURRENT ORIGINAL FUNC _require_creator_growth_installation\\ndef _require_creator_growth_installation(\\n    *, principal: Principal, catalog: EcommerceWorkshopCatalog\\n) -> EcommerceWorkshopModuleReadinessResponse:\\n    return _invoke(\\n        lambda: catalog.get_readiness(\\n            module_id=\\\"ecommerce.creator-growth\\\",\\n            org_id=principal.org_id,\\n            project_id=principal.project_id,\\n            roles=principal.roles,\\n            markings=principal.markings,\\n        )\\n    )\\nCURRENT ORIGINAL FUNC list_creator_internal_workflows\\ndef list_creator_internal_workflows(\\n    request: Request,\\n    principal: PrincipalDependency,\\n    catalog: CatalogDependency,\\n    workflow: CreatorInternalWorkflowDependency,\\n) -> CreatorInternalWorkflowListResponse:\\n    _reject_query_parameters(request)\\n    _require_creator_growth_installation(principal=principal, catalog=catalog)\\n    try:\\n        return workflow.list(TenantScope(principal.org_id, principal.project_id))\\n    except CreatorInternalWorkflowError as exc:\\n        raise _map_creator_internal_workflow_error(exc) from exc\\nEXACT intended tests delta: unreviewed sample /views/creator-growth/workflow/drafts -> /views/creator-growth/workflow/drafts/fixture/history; whitelist add listGET only; use existing lifecycle_admission typedfixture for Creator module, standaloneprobe factories. Scope principal unchanged. Typed readonly choosesnewlist; legacy choosesoldlist inclsameerror mapping; wrongadmissionNone503, catalog404 first no eitherlist, anyquery400 first no read, four newReadererrorcodes503 notitems[], validemptytyped200. Full newAST current-vs-proposed matrix changes onlythisone CatalogDependency->ReadCatalog. Allhistory/POST remainoriginal. This is intended RED source/test change, not alreadyGREEN.\"}}"}],"timestamp":1791984578918}}
